+# RDM AI Observer
+
+A read-only Dalamud development plugin for capturing structured FFXIV state and
+testing explainable Red Mage PvP recommendations. It does not send inputs or
+execute actions.
+
+The observer can switch between live state and built-in offline scenarios, so
+recommendation rules can be tested outside a Crystalline Conflict match.
 
